{"v":4,"catch":"《Upaon：貪食蛇歷險記》（Upaon: A Snake's Journey）是一款休閒迷宮遊戲，結合經典遊戲《貪食蛇》和《倉庫番》的玩法。","desc":"每次拾起水果，貪食蛇的體型就會隨之變大，記得要三思而後行……不要咬到自己了。\n\n遊戲特色：\n- 100 個手繪迷宫關卡。\n- 找出自己的解決方法：開放式迷宮，每一關都有多種解決方法。\n- 每個世界都有不同的玩法，遊戲時間全長 3 小時。\n- 5 個世界。\n- Vincent Colavita 操刀製作的原創配樂","publisher":"Silesia Games","release":"2022-02-17","genres":["益智","街機","策略","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","意大利文","荷蘭文","俄文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d11225c36d19e19b6016c3dec683a77d2740fb6cbd5daf83308a24f290c9447d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4047a57064138e0c3e8704f8924cb5f6776812910a4963751dd0f16a02b63853.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aa23ae8fc64728339b675fadeb950cc7bc35631b33cde9f021bb1f5cf24ec81f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d0a7c8c7a2fb8e5319b0cd180a9b0f6c4f6abeaa9d26f63c10ba07fe40f058e2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a982cccb2d5bfe16ffc2c099dc004473fdbfa66eba042ab16c0afff1f49876d7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8b9b3e084e38c21c803dde9a15e329505f75d37e5dff231b30fa5f692b473673.jpg"],"titleId":"0100584016d94000","dlc":[]}